gs:**\n\n- `semgrep` `llm-prompt-logged` (high) \u2014 prompt written to log \u2014 `app/assistant/views.py`\n\n**Remediation:** Log a prompt hash, not the prompt.\n\n## EU AI Act\n\n### Art. 12 \u2014 Record-keeping\n\n**Status:** not-satisfied\n\n**Findings:** 1 high\n\n**Evidence:** [Semgrep](../knowledge/scanners/semgrep.md), [Do not log prompts](../knowledge/policies/llm-prompt-logged.md)\n\n**Open findings:**\n\n- `semgrep` `llm-prompt-logged` (high) \u2014 prompt written to log \u2014 `app/assistant/views.py`\n\n**Remediation:** Log a prompt hash, not the prompt.\n\n### Art. 50 \u2014 Transparency\n\n**Status:** no-violations-detected\n\n**Evidence:** [Semgrep](../knowledge/scanners/semgrep.md), [Disclose AI-generated output](../knowledge/policies/llm-no-ai-disclosure.md)\n\n## Crosswalk\n\nLinks between frameworks. A link is navigation, never a mapping: each status\ncomes only from that control's own rule declarations.\n\n| Control | Status | Linked control | Status | Source |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| iso42001:a.7 | not-satisfied | eu-ai-act:art-12 | not-satisfied | [ISO/IEC 42001 \u2194 EU AI Act](../knowledge/crosswalk/iso42001-ai-act.md) |\n\n## Coverage gaps\n\nFindings with no in-bundle control. These are gaps to close, not mappings to invent.\n\n- `semgrep` `llm-unbounded-call` (medium) \u2014 no timeout \u2014 `app/assistant/views.py` \u2014 reason: `no-rule-match`\n\n## Not assessed\n\nNone.\n"
